RxLens — Understand Your Prescription Before You Take Your Medicine

What RxLens Does

RxLens is an AI-assisted prescription understanding platform designed to help patients better understand what is written on a doctor’s prescription and why each medicine may have been prescribed.

Many patients struggle with difficult-to-read handwriting, unfamiliar medicine names, dosage instructions, and medical terminology. RxLens aims to convert a prescription into clear, simple, patient-friendly information, helping users understand their prescription without replacing professional medical advice.

Key Features

- 📷 Prescription Upload — Upload or capture an image of a prescription.
- 🔍 Prescription Text Recognition — Extracts readable information from the prescription.
- 💊 Medicine Identification — Presents detected medicine names in an easy-to-understand format.
- 📋 Dosage & Timing View — Organizes available dosage and timing instructions clearly.
- 💡 Purpose Explanation — Provides a simple explanation of the medicine’s commonly associated purpose.
- ⚠️ Safety Alerts — Highlights information that should be verified with a doctor or pharmacist.
- 👨‍⚕️ Professional Verification — Encourages users to confirm uncertain or unclear information with a healthcare professional.
- 🌐 Simple, Accessible Interface — Designed to be easy to use for patients of different technical abilities.

Tech Stack

Frontend: React
Development Platform: Lovable
UI: Responsive web interface
AI/OCR: AI-assisted prescription text recognition and interpretation
Deployment: Web-based application

