Safety & Medical Disclaimer

RxLens is an educational and informational tool, not a medical diagnostic or treatment system.

Prescription information generated by RxLens may contain errors, especially when handwriting or prescription details are unclear. Users should not start, stop, change, or alter any medication or dosage based solely on RxLens. All prescription information, medicine identity, dosage, and treatment decisions should be verified with a qualified doctor or pharmacist.

RxLens does not replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or consultation.
